From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bacteriawa <A3167717663@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 03:06:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Carpet TIS paired 54-slot barrels

Adapted from LophineLabs/Lophine 0134 and 0135 (7a51f49a512f1b5465f15a905d3704754e4bed02).
The shared helper derives from Fallen_Breath and Carpet TIS Addition contributors
(LGPL-3.0-or-later, 62c3cb6fff26cd9c4e12aa616b403c184a4a6ca0).
Keep the two original barrel inventories on disk and apply the same pair
resolution to menus, hoppers and comparator signals.

